Underlying method: RMVPE, "A Robust Model for Vocal Pitch Estimation in
Polyphonic Music" (Wei, Bai, Zhou, Wang; INTERSPEECH 2023, arXiv:2306.15412).
The authors' own reference repository (github.com/Dream-High/RMVPE,
Apache-2.0) was considered but not used: it trains its own checkpoint at a
different mel/hop configuration, and the checkpoint we actually use (below)
was trained inside the RVC pipeline this file belongs to. Vendoring the
matching code avoids an architecture/checkpoint mismatch.

